<title>USA: Wellsford Residential Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Wellsford Residential Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.17		    $0.15</p>
<p> Net			  2,856		    2,537</p>
<p> Revs			34,652		   32,039</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name is Wellsford Residential Property Trust.</p>
<p>Q1 funds from operations available to common shareholders $9.7 million or $0.56 per share versus $8.8 million, or $0.52 per share a year ago.</p>
<p>The company said same property revenues increased about 2 percent and same property expenses decreased about 5 percent.</p>
</text>
